    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Performance, reliability and versatility</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>InterPulse offers a full line of completely disposable irrigation guns and tips for orthopaedics, trauma and wound care. The product is very simple to use: spike and shoot. Other features include:</p>\r\n",
